         •    the SSHHEELLLL, EENNVV and PPAATTHH parameters can’t be changed
         •    command names can’t be specified with absolute or relative paths
         •    the --pp option of the ccoommmmaanndd built‐in can’t be used
         •    redirections  that  create files can’t be used (_i_._e_., >>, >>||, >>>>,
              <<>>)

       A shell is pprriivviilleeggeedd if the --pp option is used or if the  real  user‐id
       or  group‐id  does not match the effective user‐id or group‐id (see _g_e_‐
