              If  the  last  command  was killed by a signal, $$?? is set to 128
              plus the signal number.

       00      The name the shell was invoked with (_i_._e_., aarrggvv[[00]]), or the ccoomm‐‐
              mmaanndd‐‐nnaammee if it was invoked with the --cc option and the  ccoommmmaanndd‐‐
              nnaammee was supplied, or the _f_i_l_e argument, if it was supplied.  If
              the ppoossiixx option is not set, $$00 is the name of the current func‐
              tion or script.

