              tion  (called  a here document), the shell copies lines from the
              command source into a  temporary  file  until  a  line  matching
              _m_a_r_k_e_r is read.  When the command is executed, standard input is
              redirected  from  the  temporary  file.   If  _m_a_r_k_e_r contains no
