        _f_l_a_g  is ++ or ‐‐ if the job is the %%++ or %%‐‐ job, respectively, or space
              if it is neither.

        _s_t_a_t_u_s
              indicates the current state of the job and can be

              RRuunnnniinngg
                     the  job has neither stopped or exited (note that running
